MODULE: RebuildPublishesRawPreparedPrefix
TARGET: PublishedBatchAtomic
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: shadow rebuild reads individually installed rows without transaction-decision visibility
PERTURBS: Scan

--- FIND
    /\ shadow' = Source /\ phase' = "scanned"
--- REPLACE
    /\ shadow' = RawSource /\ phase' = "scanned"
--- END
